2 PLAC New York, NY
1 OCCU Engineer
1 NOTE This is a note
1 NOTE Second note
1 FAMS @F1@
0 @I2@ INDI
1 NAME Jane /Smith/
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE JAN 1988
2 PLAC Boston, MA
1 FAMS @F1@
0 @I3@ INDI
1 NAME Robert /Smith/
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1990
1 FAMC @F1@
0 @F1@ FAM
1 HUSB @I1@
1 WIFE @I2@
1 CHIL @I3@
1 MARR
2 DATE 10 JUN 1985
2 PLAC Boston, MA
1 NOTE Family note
0 TRLR`;

